Package: googlesecretmanager
Title: Manage Google Cloud Platform Secrets with R
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Brancen", "Gregory", , "brancengregory@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    Create, inspect, update, and delete Google Cloud Secret Manager
    secrets and their versions directly from R. The package wraps the
    Secret Manager API v1 and uses 'gargle' for authentication, supporting
    interactive OAuth, service account keys, and pre-existing tokens.
    Secret and version metadata are returned as S3 objects with print
    methods that avoid revealing secret values, and listing operations
    return data frames with one row per secret or version. Default
    project settings, labels, filters, and the full version lifecycle
    (add, access, enable, disable, and delete) are supported.
